── P2-11 字符串索引与内建 ──
s[1] = h | s[5] = o | s[9] = null (越界→null)
中文 len = 4 | cn[1] = 中 | cn[2] = 文 | cn[4] = 试
substr(cn,2,2) = 文测 | ord(cn,1) = 20013
chr(20013) = 中 | ord(chr(65)) = 65
substr(s,2,3) = ell | substr(s,4,99) = lo
find(s,"ll") = 3 | find(s,"z") = null
upper/lower: ABC abc
trim: [pad]
replace: a+b+c
split: {a, b, c} | len = 3
join: a | b | c
repeat: ababab
── P2-12 format ──
42 items, 3.14%, ok, ff
[   42][42   ][00042]
文字 的中文长度 2
百分号: 100%
── P2-14 表原语 ──
初始: {1, 2, 3} len = 3 count = 3
append(t,4) = 4 → {1, 2, 3, 4}
insert(t,1,0) = 5 → {0, 1, 2, 3, 4}
pop(t) = 4 → {0, 1, 2, 3} count = 4
delete(t,2) = true → {0, null, 2, 3} len = 1
delete 不存在的键 = false
delete(d,"name") = true → {"flag" = true} count = 1
── P2-15 稀疏整数键 ──
sp[1000000] = far | count = 1 | len = 0
sp2[100] = mid | t[1] = 1 | count = 3
── P2-16 拷贝与深相等 ──
浅拷贝共享内层: true
深拷贝不共享内层: false
equal(a,b) = true | equal(a,c) = true
环深拷贝后仍自引用: true
equal(cyc,cyc2) = true
